discord-axi

internal/discordo contains files copied from Discordo
(https://github.com/ayn2op/discordo), Copyright (c) ayn2op, licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0. The transport, TLS profile, gateway dialer and
identify properties are otherwise unmodified, so this CLI talks to Discord
exactly like Discordo does. Changes:

  - import paths and the keyring service name
  - generated.go: ClientBuildNumber became a var, so it can be refreshed from
    Discord's login page at runtime instead of staying frozen at build time

